In this Case Study, we discuss with Sam about her journey with Finance with Flow, and how we have made a difference to her company's progress to date.

### Company Background 

Tipsy Bubbles were into their first year of business and were looking for someone to support them with their bookkeeping and accounting duties which had grown too much of a chore.

When looking to source someone, they were looking for a team who were friendly, approachable and knowledgeable that offered an outsourced finance service and they felt that Finance with Flow were the best suited for the team. Finance with Flow also had a rather comprehensive portfolio that offered other services such as year-end accounts.

### Onboarding Process 

Finance with Flow were very quick to get started on the work and it was a seamless integration with the team, who I worked very closely with. I was taken through each step along the way and felt comfortable contacting them with any question, big or small and they were always very quick to assist.

### Service and Communication 

I can only describe the service from Finance with Flow as – Excellent!

Being able to hand over the stress of my finances to an outsourced finance department was key to me being able to focus on other areas of my business, feeling safe in the knowledge that my finances were all under control.  

I am able to book one-one meetings, at convenient times and places that works around my life and business, and I leave those meetings immediately feeling like the pressure has been lifted.

The communication between myself and the Finance with Flow team is second to none. I am always in the know and provided with simple, clear and concise information.

### Expertise and Support 

Finance with Flow are very knowledgeable outsourced finance department and the whole team has provided me with a fantastic advisory service, which has proved to be a game changer for my business.

I always feel supported by the team and they are always there when I need their support and guidance.

### Impact on business

Without the help and support from having Finance with Flow as my outsourced finance team, I don’t think I would have been able to continue with my business. Being able to hand over the stress of understanding the financial side of the business to experts, meant that I could focus on other areas.

With a combined effort specialising on our strengths, we have been able to ensure that the business not only stays afloat, I now have processes in place, and growth targets to focus on.

### How Satisfied are you?

Out of 1-10, Finance with Flow definitely gets a big 10 from me! They are excellent on every level!

I have already and would continue to recommend Finance with Flow’s outsourced finance services to anyone who is feeling overwhelmed and looking for support for the financial side of their business.

Handing over the financial reins has enabled me to concentrate on the day to day running of the business with success.

Thank you Finance with Flow for your support!

